  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason (variance) is not considered by the individual. The verbal report focuses on the perceived attractiveness of probabilities and the closeness of the probabilities in B, not on the spread or variability of outcomes. The decision reason's rule—preferring the lottery with smaller variance—is not reflected in the individual’s justification. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The assessment is that the reason was not used.",
